{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaze of Storm is a vertical-scrolling shmup featuring cyber-inspired pixel art, exhilarating fast-scrolling, and a variety of sub-weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cyberdiver, you'll delve into cyberspace and battle a diverse range of enemies. Each of the five selectable sub-weapons has its own unique characteristics, making it fun to use them appropriately depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, when a sub-weapon comes into contact with an enemy, it generates an explosion that deals continuous damage. Making good use of this explosion is key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 unique bosses appear one after another, providing a varied and condensed gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 794 of the Cyber Century, the nation was managed by a giant computer called &quot;Elixia.&quot; Elixia controlled all aspects of politics, economy, and the military, making war and poverty a thing of the past. However, that peace suddenly crumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified enemies appeared in cyberspace and began to erode the system of Elixia. The city's infrastructure was in chaos, communication networks were cut off, and people faced fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In response to this situation, cyberdiver &quot;Ayame Crow&quot; began investigating cyberspace. Cyberdivers are people with special abilities who can directly connect their consciousness to cyberspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind this crisis, it was discovered that there was a human being called &quot;Phantom&quot; who uploaded his mind into cyberspace. He was plotting to control Elixia in order to lead humanity to chaos that he called freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayame boards the cyber fighter Image Striker and contacts Elixir. Now, the battle to save humanity from crisis begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CARAVAN_CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/79b117bae54e090c5aca4ee33273d6fa85e51b74.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL_CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/bf3f2e1249781ea07fc358429e6071e8283cf964.jpg"},{"name":"HARD_CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/8b516e2634449cb7fdf94101e10d5dd4d9667311.jpg"},{"name":"EXPERT_CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/e9f9e18b2b0d958f00ed052139c26c2fd5393a71.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL_1CC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/89e290ed9f6d1f79001e2be4fbeb433f99e517e1.jpg"},{"name":"HARD_1CC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/2797ca009515c61789a30aa8bd1d1d0197331864.jpg"},{"name":"EXPERT_1CC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513070/4419dbcdb659ad559a8e42b08a185f93f4165f3c.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1773144751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/6c9f300c43f2ebf5cc6be8f1f0fb742802a5be63/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773144751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/a5f762c43ff9332feceab28c6eac11feaf7ce70b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773144751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/a5f762c43ff9332feceab28c6eac11feaf7ce70b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773144751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Cu